<title>FRANCE: Saab Auto to raise output 10 pct in 1997.</title>
<headline>Saab Auto to raise output 10 pct in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish car maker Saab Automobile said on Wednesday it would raise production by around 10 percent in 1997, and continue to increase production by 10 percent annually for the following three to four years.</p>
</text>
